title: "Data Lake Architecture (Governed Lakehouse on Object Storage)"
category: "Storage & Data Platforms"
difficulty: "Hard"
tags: ["data-lake", "lakehouse", "iceberg", "hudi", "governance", "catalog", "trino", "spark", "flink"]
